WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.767
-Attorney General
Merrick Garland

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:04.234
has appointed a special counsel

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:06.434
to look into the classified
documents that were found

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.934
at President Biden's home
and office

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:10.300
from his time as vice president.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.267
Meanwhile,
Fox News and the GOP

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:15.667
have been stoking a ridiculous
new freakout about gas stoves.

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:17.634
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:21.601
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:23.734
When it comes
to job approval ratings,

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:25.968
Joe Biden went through a rough
stretch last year.

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:28.033
His numbers were down,
gas prices were up,

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:29.334
inflation was rampant,

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:30.667
and he was constantly
getting hammered

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:32.000
by reporters
with tough questions.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.868
You could see it
in his body language.

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:36.133
During press conferences,
he'd just close his eyes

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:37.801
[ Laughter ]
and put his head down,

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:39.968
like the questions were causing
him physical pain.

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:41.834
That's what my mom does
when my dad starts

00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:43.734
telling a story
she's heard multiple times.

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:44.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:46.734
"Oh, my God.

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:47.968
[ Applause ]

00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:50.100
Nobody cares
that the car wash forgot

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.901
to charge you
for the spray wax."

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:55.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:58.067
And you could tell just how
low his confidence was.

00:00:58.067 --> 00:00:59.400
Remember how he used
to do that thing

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.133
where he'd list
his accomplishments,

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:02.934
but he'd whisper them
into the mic,

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:04.434
like they were a secret?

00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:06.033
-Hey, guys.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:07.100
[ Whispering ]
I think it's time

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.934
to give ordinary people
a tax break.

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:14.968
I made it clear to my friends
up in Nantucket and that area

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:16.701
[ Whispering ]
I don't want to hear any more
about you don't like

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:17.901
looking at them.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:21.534
You know, Michelle, he knows,
we all know --

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:23.033
[ Whispering ]
he couldn't have done it
without you.

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:26.133
[ Laughter ]
Ask me, "Well, you know,
guess what.

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:28.501
Employers can't find workers."

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:29.634
[ Whispering ]
I said, "Yeah.

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:31.167
Pay them more."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:33.300
I wrote the bill

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.167
on the environment.

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:40.200
I got them $1.9 trillion relief,
so far.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.067
[ Laughter ]
Biden was so cautious
at the time,

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:46.267
he was afraid people would
find out what he was doing.

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:48.200
[ As Biden ]
Look, let's just keep this

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.667
between you, me,
and the TV cameras, okay?

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.100
I mean, was he answering
questions at a press conference

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.133
or trying not to spook a horse?

00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:57.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.133 --> 00:01:58.367
Was that the press conference

00:01:58.367 --> 00:01:59.968
where all the reporters
were horses?

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.834
Alright, steady, now, steady.

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:04.734
Let's do this
in an orderly fashion.

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:06.801
Any questions?

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:09.901
[ Hooves stampeding ]
Whoa! Whoa!

00:02:09.901 --> 00:02:13.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:16.000
That whisper is the same move I
pull when I try to trick my kids

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.901
into doing something
they don't want to do.

00:02:17.901 --> 00:02:21.067
[ As Biden, whispering ]
Alright, guys, I got a super
duper secret mission for you,

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:22.734
but you -- you can't tell Mom.

00:02:22.734 --> 00:02:25.934
We got to clean up all our LEGOs
as fast as possible.

00:02:25.934 --> 00:02:27.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:28.467
And they know it's bull[bleep],

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:30.000
so they immediately start
making demands.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.701
"I want a lollipop!
I want a 'Paw Patrol'!"

00:02:31.701 --> 00:02:34.067
And they just keep screaming
at me until I pull a Biden.

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:38.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:40.968
Point is things were going great
for Biden, polling-wise,

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:42.968
then he scored a string
of legislative victories,

00:02:42.968 --> 00:02:44.968
gas prices fell,
inflation slowed down,

00:02:44.968 --> 00:02:47.534
unemployment stayed low,
and Republicans melted down

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:49.100
after a disastrous
midterm election

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.234
that left them with a weak

00:02:50.234 --> 00:02:52.300
and fractious majority
in the House.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.400
And, according
to The Economist...

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.601
I mean, I would say Biden
did cartwheels

00:03:05.601 --> 00:03:07.234
through the White House
when he heard those numbers,

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:09.601
but I think we all know
that would not end well

00:03:09.601 --> 00:03:10.467
We play --

00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:12.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.400
We play that clip a lot,
but here's the deal --

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.567
If you're the most
powerful person in the world

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:22.934
and you somehow trip
up the stairs...

00:03:22.934 --> 00:03:24.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:25.734
...not once,
but multiple times,

00:03:25.734 --> 00:03:26.567
we gonna roast you.

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:27.567
You know, in fact,

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:29.100
I have a button on my desk

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.334
that I can press at any time

00:03:30.334 --> 00:03:32.100
to roll that clip
in case of an emergency

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:35.100
or if Wally accidentally
has a wardrobe malfunction.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.234
-That's ridiculous, Seth.

00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:37.767
How would I have
a wardrobe malfunction?

00:03:37.767 --> 00:03:40.634
-Wally, why are you holding
the cue cards

00:03:40.634 --> 00:03:42.701
up in front
of your chest like that?

00:03:42.701 --> 00:03:44.901
-Oh, this? I just forgot to put
on my nipple covers today.

00:03:44.901 --> 00:03:47.634
Want to see?
-No! No! No!

00:03:47.634 --> 00:03:49.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.667 --> 00:03:51.000
[ Applause ]

00:03:55.567 --> 00:03:56.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:56.834 --> 00:03:59.267
The point is Biden's approval
ratings are up now

00:03:59.267 --> 00:04:01.300
and Americans are happy
with the way he's doing his job.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.300
He's riding high
and I'm sure nothing --

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.734
nothing --
could possibly screw that up.

00:04:05.734 --> 00:04:07.200
-Attorney General
Merrick Garland

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.434
appointed a special counsel
to oversee the investigation

00:04:10.434 --> 00:04:13.567
of classified documents found
on President Biden's property.

00:04:13.567 --> 00:04:14.801
-Seth.

00:04:14.801 --> 00:04:17.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.234 --> 00:04:19.467
[ Applause ]

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:22.367
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:22.367 --> 00:04:23.367
[ Whistling ]

00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:24.234
-I don't know.

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:29.601
Just it's a big story.
I thought it'd be a longer clip.

00:04:29.601 --> 00:04:31.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.534 --> 00:04:33.067
Oh, sure, when Trump --

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:36.567
when it's classified documents
for Trump, 45 seconds!

00:04:36.567 --> 00:04:39.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.667
Let --
Play it one more time.

00:04:45.667 --> 00:04:47.133
I'll show you what it was
supposed to look like.

00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:48.267
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.267 --> 00:04:49.734
-Attorney General
Merrick Garland

00:04:49.734 --> 00:04:52.901
appointed a special counsel
to oversee the investigation

00:04:52.901 --> 00:04:55.901
of classified documents found
on President Biden's property.

00:04:55.901 --> 00:04:57.367
-Well, [bleep].

00:04:57.367 --> 00:04:59.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:59.701 --> 00:05:02.033
Or, as Biden would say --

00:05:02.033 --> 00:05:03.334
[ As Biden, whispering ]
Well, [bleep].

00:05:03.334 --> 00:05:06.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:06.534 --> 00:05:08.334
So, obviously --

00:05:08.334 --> 00:05:10.434
[ Cheering ]

00:05:10.434 --> 00:05:12.267
Obviously,
it's not great for Biden

00:05:12.267 --> 00:05:14.601
that there's a special counsel
looking into the storage

00:05:14.601 --> 00:05:16.968
of classified documents
from his time as vice president,

00:05:16.968 --> 00:05:18.767
although, there are
huge differences

00:05:18.767 --> 00:05:21.534
between this and Trump's case,
which we'll get to in a sec.

00:05:21.534 --> 00:05:24.234
Biden's team reportedly found
a small number of documents

00:05:24.234 --> 00:05:26.534
in two locations,
including the garage

00:05:26.534 --> 00:05:29.901
where his Corvette is parked,
which he was asked about today.

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:31.400
-According
to President Joe Biden,

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.934
these classified documents were
found in his personal library

00:05:34.934 --> 00:05:37.868
and in the garage of his home
in Wilmington, Delaware.

00:05:37.868 --> 00:05:39.133
Just moments ago,

00:05:39.133 --> 00:05:41.300
Biden addressed the matter
very briefly,

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:42.901
saying it was a locked garage

00:05:42.901 --> 00:05:45.334
where he also keeps
his Corvette.

00:05:45.334 --> 00:05:47.367
-Let me --
I'm going to get a chance

00:05:47.367 --> 00:05:49.367
to speak on all of this,
God willing, soon,

00:05:49.367 --> 00:05:51.767
but as I said earlier
this week, people --

00:05:51.767 --> 00:05:54.667
and, by the way, my Corvette's
in a locked garage, okay?

00:05:54.667 --> 00:05:56.767
So, it's not like they're
sitting out in the street.

00:05:56.767 --> 00:05:58.767
But, as I said earlier
this week,

00:05:58.767 --> 00:06:01.734
people know I take
classified documents

00:06:01.734 --> 00:06:04.200
and classified material
seriously.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.968
I also said we're cooperating
fully and completely

00:06:06.968 --> 00:06:08.801
with the Justice Department's
review.

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.267
-I mean, I guess,
if you're going to store

00:06:10.267 --> 00:06:12.667
classified documents somewhere,
you might as well do it next

00:06:12.667 --> 00:06:14.567
to your kickass Corvette,
you know,

00:06:14.567 --> 00:06:16.400
[ Laughter ]
so that, when they
eventually find them,

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.267
you can brag
that you have a Corvette.

00:06:18.267 --> 00:06:19.868
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.868 --> 00:06:21.334
If I took classified documents,

00:06:21.334 --> 00:06:22.868
I'd keep them next
to my Emmy statue,

00:06:22.868 --> 00:06:24.534
just so, when the feds came
to my house, I could say,

00:06:24.534 --> 00:06:26.901
"Oh, that whole thing?
It's just an Emmy Award.

00:06:26.901 --> 00:06:29.601
It's for songwriting,
but they all count the same!"

00:06:29.601 --> 00:06:31.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:31.367 --> 00:06:34.534
I will say it's a fitting place
to find them, considering Trump

00:06:34.534 --> 00:06:36.901
had his classified documents
at Mar-A-Lago

00:06:36.901 --> 00:06:39.334
because Biden's Mar-A-Lago
is definitely

00:06:39.334 --> 00:06:41.033
a garage with a Corvette in it.

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:43.467
[ Laughter ]
[ As Biden ] Honey, I'm off
to my private club.

00:06:43.467 --> 00:06:44.501
"You mean the garage?"

00:06:44.501 --> 00:06:46.901
That's right -- Car-A-Lago!

00:06:46.901 --> 00:06:49.367
[ Laughter ]

00:06:50.267 --> 00:06:52.534
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:06:52.534 --> 00:06:54.200
Also, I like Biden's insistence

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.601
that the Corvette
was locked away.

00:06:55.601 --> 00:06:56.534
[ As Biden ]
That baby's locked away.

00:06:56.534 --> 00:06:57.734
It's never coming out.

00:06:57.734 --> 00:06:59.334
One time I left it parked
in the street

00:06:59.334 --> 00:07:00.968
and some kids
in the neighborhood

00:07:00.968 --> 00:07:01.901
took it for a joyride.

00:07:01.901 --> 00:07:03.501
I'll never forget what I heard

00:07:03.501 --> 00:07:04.901
as they were driving away.

00:07:04.901 --> 00:07:06.067
[ Yello's "Oh Yeah" plays ]

00:07:06.067 --> 00:07:08.067
[ Laughter and applause ]
-♪ Oh, yeah ♪

00:07:12.167 --> 00:07:14.467
-Bueller!

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:16.300
Now, obviously,
this is not great for Biden

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.300
and he shouldn't have had
those documents,

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.067
although, personally, I feel
like finding a small number

00:07:20.067 --> 00:07:22.234
of classified documents
in someone's home or office

00:07:22.234 --> 00:07:24.067
is not a big deal,
as long as they give them back,

00:07:24.067 --> 00:07:25.701
which is true for Trump, too.

00:07:25.701 --> 00:07:27.334
If Trump had just given back
all the documents

00:07:27.334 --> 00:07:28.534
when he was asked,
we wouldn't have had a problem

00:07:28.534 --> 00:07:29.567
and that's
the difference, right?

00:07:29.567 --> 00:07:31.067
Biden is cooperating fully,

00:07:31.067 --> 00:07:33.100
turning over all the documents
immediately, looking for more.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:34.434
Trump refused to turn them over

00:07:34.434 --> 00:07:36.000
for more than a year
after repeated requests,

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.200
claims he could declassify them
with his mind,

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:39.367
[ Laughter ]
lied about them,

00:07:39.367 --> 00:07:41.300
and even moved them around,
which is what led

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:42.601
to the FBI search

00:07:42.601 --> 00:07:44.868
that discovered
even more classified documents

00:07:44.868 --> 00:07:46.501
that Trump had refused
to turn over,

00:07:46.501 --> 00:07:48.067
which makes the GOP attempt
to draw

00:07:48.067 --> 00:07:51.100
a false equivalence
between the two very silly.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:54.234
-Why aren't they in there
right now, with subpoenas,

00:07:54.234 --> 00:07:56.567
going through every single
record there?

00:07:56.567 --> 00:07:58.434
-Where's the raid?!
-Classified documents.

00:07:58.434 --> 00:07:59.667
Right.
Where is the raid?

00:07:59.667 --> 00:08:01.033
And let me -- let me --
-Where's the FBI raid?

00:08:01.033 --> 00:08:03.701
-We have a quote here
from Representative James Comer,

00:08:03.701 --> 00:08:05.767
from the Oversight Committee,
who said...

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.067
-Monday night,
in a post, Trump asked...

00:08:17.701 --> 00:08:19.734
[ Laughter ]
-Why would the FBI raid someone

00:08:19.734 --> 00:08:22.434
who is already handing over
everything they're asking for?

00:08:22.434 --> 00:08:24.634
I don't know, maybe so
they could get a sneak peek

00:08:24.634 --> 00:08:25.734
at that Corvette?

00:08:25.734 --> 00:08:27.601
[ Laughter ]
"FBI! Open up!

00:08:27.601 --> 00:08:29.801
Now, hand over the keys to that
car and retract the roof.

00:08:29.801 --> 00:08:31.467
I want to feel the wind
in my hair!"

00:08:31.467 --> 00:08:33.000
[ Laughter ]

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.601
Why does Trump think they should
raid the White House?

00:08:36.601 --> 00:08:38.801
If there's anywhere
a classified document should be,

00:08:38.801 --> 00:08:40.300
it's the White House.

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.300
[ Laughter ]

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:43.267
Trump would make
an awful detective.

00:08:43.267 --> 00:08:45.767
[ As Trump ]
Okay, guys, now we just need
to find some evidence.

00:08:45.767 --> 00:08:48.167
I say we raid
the evidence locker.

00:08:48.167 --> 00:08:50.400
[ Laughter ]

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:53.100
They're all in bags.
This is very suspicious.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:54.667 --> 00:08:56.400
They're all --
There's labels.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.534
Everything's in a bag.

00:08:57.534 --> 00:08:58.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:58.667 --> 00:08:59.834
Again, the situation --

00:08:59.834 --> 00:09:01.601
there's dead bodies
in the morgue.

00:09:01.601 --> 00:09:03.234
Bad news.

00:09:03.234 --> 00:09:05.200
[ Laughter ]
Call Homicide.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.968
I opened up one
of those drawers.

00:09:06.968 --> 00:09:09.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:10.501
I figured it out.

00:09:10.501 --> 00:09:13.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:13.868 --> 00:09:15.834
Again, the situations
are very different,

00:09:15.834 --> 00:09:17.767
although,
the timing is not great,

00:09:17.767 --> 00:09:19.801
given that Biden has been
riding high in the polls.

00:09:19.801 --> 00:09:21.667
And, as a general rule,
whenever Biden is riding high,

00:09:21.667 --> 00:09:23.968
the GOP and Fox News
crank up the freakometer

00:09:23.968 --> 00:09:25.434
to try to scare you
about something dumb,

00:09:25.434 --> 00:09:27.667
like the War on Christmas
or woke M&amp;M's.

00:09:27.667 --> 00:09:28.667
For example,
you might remember that,

00:09:28.667 --> 00:09:29.968
early in Biden's presidency,

00:09:29.968 --> 00:09:33.133
Fox claimed he was trying
to ban hamburgers.

00:09:33.133 --> 00:09:34.601
-Say goodbye to your burgers,

00:09:34.601 --> 00:09:37.501
if you want to sign up
for the Biden climate agenda.

00:09:37.501 --> 00:09:42.000
-He wants to cut out 90% of the
red meat that you all eat.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.868
That's four pounds a year.

00:09:43.868 --> 00:09:45.734
-No burgers on July 4th.

00:09:45.734 --> 00:09:48.100
No steaks on the barbie.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.634
[ Laughter ]
I'm sure middle America

00:09:49.634 --> 00:09:51.167
is just going to love that.

00:09:51.167 --> 00:09:53.767
I'm sorry,
but what American refers

00:09:53.767 --> 00:09:55.300
to the barbecue as the barbie?

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:57.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:57.801 --> 00:10:00.000
You sound like
an Australian spy trying

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.133
to blend in
as an undercover American.

00:10:02.133 --> 00:10:02.934
[ Cheering ]

00:10:02.934 --> 00:10:04.634
"Hey, blokes, who wants to grill

00:10:04.634 --> 00:10:06.734
some American hamburgers
on the barbie?

00:10:06.734 --> 00:10:09.067
[ Laughter ]
Then we can go on a walkabout

00:10:09.067 --> 00:10:11.300
into the Outback
to look for some koalas,

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:12.734
maybe play the didgeridoo.

00:10:12.734 --> 00:10:13.734
I mean the guitar!

00:10:13.734 --> 00:10:14.601
[ Australian accent ]
Crikey!

00:10:14.601 --> 00:10:15.834
I think they're on to me, mate!

00:10:15.834 --> 00:10:18.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:18.667 --> 00:10:19.667
You got to get me out.

00:10:19.667 --> 00:10:21.701
They're as cross
as a frog in a sock, oi!

00:10:21.701 --> 00:10:24.634
[ Laughter ]

00:10:26.634 --> 00:10:29.100
I think that was a German
pretending to be --

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.367
[ Laughter ]
That was a German spy

00:10:31.367 --> 00:10:33.868
pretending to be
an Australian spy,

00:10:33.868 --> 00:10:35.100
pretending to be an American.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.367
[ Laughter ]

00:10:36.367 --> 00:10:38.767
That's the depths of the accent
work I'm doing.

00:10:38.767 --> 00:10:40.501
[ Laughter ]

00:10:40.501 --> 00:10:42.434
Hard as it is to believe,
none of that was true.

00:10:42.434 --> 00:10:44.334
Despite greedy
old Joe Biden trying

00:10:44.334 --> 00:10:45.901
to get his sweaty paws
on your hamburgers,

00:10:45.901 --> 00:10:48.100
red meat was still legal
on July 4th,

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.334
so, now, Fox has moved on to yet
another loopy little freakout --

00:10:51.334 --> 00:10:54.734
Biden is coming to your house
to take away your gas stove.

00:10:54.734 --> 00:10:58.267
-Could the Biden administration
be coming for your gas stove?

00:10:58.267 --> 00:10:59.968
The answer is yes!

00:10:59.968 --> 00:11:01.801
-Joe Biden's climate
change agenda

00:11:01.801 --> 00:11:03.267
now targeting your kitchen.

00:11:03.267 --> 00:11:05.868
-Your family dinner is
about to get a lot less tasty.

00:11:05.868 --> 00:11:08.200
-The White House
is now attempting to ban

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.634
all gas ovens and burners.

00:11:10.634 --> 00:11:12.467
-Biden's coming
for your gas stove.

00:11:12.467 --> 00:11:14.868
-A ban on your gas stove.

00:11:14.868 --> 00:11:16.901
-Ban gas-powered stoves.

00:11:16.901 --> 00:11:19.567
-A stove like this one
could be banned soon.

00:11:19.567 --> 00:11:22.133
-Your gas stove may be buh-bye.

00:11:22.133 --> 00:11:24.434
[ Laughter ]
-I'm not giving up my gas stove.

00:11:24.434 --> 00:11:26.534
-If you touch my propane,
then I'm really going

00:11:26.534 --> 00:11:28.367
to be ticked off, right?
-Yeah, it's not happening.

00:11:28.367 --> 00:11:30.567
-Nobody's going to tell me
I can't cook with gas!

00:11:30.567 --> 00:11:32.701
-[ As Pirro ]
Nobody's going to tell me
I can cook with gas!

00:11:32.701 --> 00:11:34.601
[ Laughter ]
You could try,
but I'm not going to hear you

00:11:34.601 --> 00:11:36.300
because I never stop talking
and, when I talk,

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.367
I can't even hear a jet plane
when it flies overhead!

00:11:38.367 --> 00:11:39.901
[ Laughter ]

00:11:39.901 --> 00:11:41.834
Now, I do say, I just realized

00:11:41.834 --> 00:11:44.000
if you averaged out Joe Biden
and Jeanine Pirro,

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.300
you would get one normal
speaking voice.

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.534
[ Laughter ]

00:11:48.534 --> 00:11:50.200
Then there was
Congressman Ronny Jackson

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.501
from Texas.
You might remember him.

00:11:51.501 --> 00:11:53.934
Jackson had his own little
meltdown on Twitter,

00:11:53.934 --> 00:11:54.601
where he wrote...

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.634
[ Laughter ]

00:12:04.634 --> 00:12:07.567
I do like to imagine
what circumstances would lead

00:12:07.567 --> 00:12:11.434
to someone dying
while clutching their gas stove.

00:12:11.434 --> 00:12:13.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:13.601 --> 00:12:17.067
"Honey, I think there's
a burglar downstairs.

00:12:17.067 --> 00:12:18.734
Hand me my stove."

00:12:18.734 --> 00:12:21.834
[ Laughter and applause ]
Then the cops would show up
all confused.

00:12:21.834 --> 00:12:23.200
"Well, I guess we better pry
that thing

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.701
from his cold, dead hands."

00:12:24.701 --> 00:12:25.701
[ New York accent ]
Good news, Chief --

00:12:25.701 --> 00:12:27.000
the hands aren't actually
that cold,

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.801
you know, on account of him
holding the stove.

00:12:28.801 --> 00:12:31.701
[ Laughter ]

00:12:36.133 --> 00:12:37.534
Although, I think
my favorite example has

00:12:37.534 --> 00:12:39.000
to be this one,
from Tucker Carlson,

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.467
who was in the middle
of a segment about something

00:12:40.467 --> 00:12:42.300
completely different
when he said this --

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:44.234
-At the same time, these same
people are telling us

00:12:44.234 --> 00:12:47.100
that it's "dangerous"
to use a natural gas stove

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:49.000
in your home,
because of emissions,

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:52.100
but they're not concerned
about smoking meth?

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.567
[ Laughter ]
Like at some point,
you have to wonder like

00:12:53.567 --> 00:12:55.133
what's really going on here?

00:12:55.133 --> 00:12:56.434
-Yeah, man, what the hell?!

00:12:56.434 --> 00:12:59.334
When are they finally going
to make meth illegal?

00:12:59.334 --> 00:13:02.167
[ Laughter ]

00:13:04.334 --> 00:13:05.400
But he's right about one thing.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:06.601
You really do have to wonder.

00:13:06.601 --> 00:13:08.067
[ As Carlson ]
I mean, what's going on here?

00:13:08.067 --> 00:13:09.367
They want to take
your stove away,

00:13:09.367 --> 00:13:11.534
but they don't care
if you smoke meth?

00:13:11.534 --> 00:13:12.934
Are they going
to take your stove

00:13:12.934 --> 00:13:14.734
and replace it with a meth lab?

00:13:14.734 --> 00:13:16.567
[ Laughter ]
And then if everyone has

00:13:16.567 --> 00:13:18.067
a meth lab in their home,
what will happen

00:13:18.067 --> 00:13:19.934
to the price of meth
on the street?

00:13:19.934 --> 00:13:21.801
[ Laughter ]
Will this put
hardworking Americans,

00:13:21.801 --> 00:13:23.767
like Gustavo Fring, out of work?

00:13:23.767 --> 00:13:25.434
[ Laughter ]
Maybe you're thinking,

00:13:25.434 --> 00:13:27.200
"Can't he just fall back
on his restaurant,

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.267
Los Pollos Hermanos?"

00:13:28.267 --> 00:13:29.968
Not anymore, he can't.

00:13:29.968 --> 00:13:30.834
[ Laughter ]

00:13:30.834 --> 00:13:32.133
Because they took his stove.

00:13:32.133 --> 00:13:36.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:36.834 --> 00:13:38.334
So, here's what --

00:13:39.067 --> 00:13:40.400
...here's what's actually
going on.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:41.834
Recent studies have confirmed

00:13:41.834 --> 00:13:44.167
something scientists have been
researching for a long time,

00:13:44.167 --> 00:13:46.567
which is that gas stove
pollution can be harmful

00:13:46.567 --> 00:13:47.901
and cause a variety
of health problems,

00:13:47.901 --> 00:13:49.267
including childhood asthma.

00:13:49.267 --> 00:13:50.367
In fact, the risks are...

00:13:52.734 --> 00:13:54.501
Now, let me just stop here
to say

00:13:54.501 --> 00:13:56.133
that it doesn't exactly shock me
to find out

00:13:56.133 --> 00:13:58.767
that burning gas inside your
house on a daily basis

00:13:58.767 --> 00:14:01.100
might not be like
the best thing for you.

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:04.467
[ Laughter ]
Maybe this is new information,
but it can't be that surprising.

00:14:04.467 --> 00:14:07.434
Like on the spectrum
of shocking revelations,

00:14:07.434 --> 00:14:10.033
there's finding out that gas
stoves are bad for you

00:14:10.033 --> 00:14:12.300
[ Raising voice ]
and then there's finding out
that Prince Harry

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:15.100
had frostbite on his penis
at William and Kate's wedding.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:16.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:16.467 --> 00:14:19.734
That is a real thing
from his book.

00:14:19.734 --> 00:14:21.400
I did not make that up.

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.367
[ Laughter ]

00:14:23.367 --> 00:14:26.133
Wally, have you ever had
frostbite on your penis?

00:14:26.133 --> 00:14:27.567
-Seth, it's funny
you should ask.

00:14:29.334 --> 00:14:32.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:34.667 --> 00:14:35.901
So, anyway...

00:14:35.901 --> 00:14:37.300
[ Laughter ]
Then a member of the

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:39.334
U.S. Consumer Product
Safety Commission said...

00:14:43.501 --> 00:14:45.200
That was quickly
clarified yesterday

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.801
by the chair of the commission,
who said...

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.601
"...and the commission has
no proceedings to do so."

00:14:51.601 --> 00:14:54.133
So, the whole freakout was
much ado about nothing.

00:14:54.133 --> 00:14:55.701
No one is taking your gas stove.

00:14:55.701 --> 00:14:58.033
That said, you can get cash
incentives from the government

00:14:58.033 --> 00:15:00.667
to switch to an electric
or induction stove --

00:15:00.667 --> 00:15:01.934
if you want --

00:15:01.934 --> 00:15:03.501
which is better for both you
and the environment,

00:15:03.501 --> 00:15:04.534
but it is up to you.

00:15:04.534 --> 00:15:06.234
If you feel really strongly
about it,

00:15:06.234 --> 00:15:09.501
you can keep cooking with gas.
You can even use gas to cook,

00:15:09.501 --> 00:15:10.667
as Americans would say...

00:15:10.667 --> 00:15:12.200
-Steaks on the barbie.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.968
[ Laughter ]

00:15:13.968 --> 00:15:15.367
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:15:15.367 --> 00:15:19.133
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

